(7415528, 1169383, 32108, '<td valign="top">my first vote was 4 but on second viewing bumping to 7 as I''m starting to see the art in it</td>', 'my first vote was 4 but on second viewing bumping to 7 as I''m starting to see the art in it', '2015-11-10 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415594, 1169334, 73942, '<td valign="top">so creative, love this</td>', 'so creative, love this', '2015-11-11 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415649, 1169546, 51328, '<td valign="top">Mystery vehicle  Almost a bullet car</td>', 'Mystery vehicle  Almost a bullet car', '2015-11-11 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415752, 1169334, 181383, '<td valign="top">I don''t have much to offer in the way of comments.  A toy car and a frog just don''t work for me.  To each his own.  :)</td>', 'I don''t have much to offer in the way of comments.  A toy car and a frog just don''t work for me.  To each his own.  :)', '2015-11-11 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415753, 1169383, 181383, '<td valign="top">Sorry...I am just not getting the message here.</td>', 'Sorry...I am just not getting the message here.', '2015-11-11 15:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415754, 1169455, 181383, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t make me think or respond in any way, really.  Other than I thought the driver was going too darn fast!  :) Maybe if more elements were in focus.  I don''t know....</td>', 'This photo doesn''t make me think or respond in any way, really.  Other than I thought the driver was going too darn fast!  :) Maybe if more elements were in focus.  I don''t know....', '2015-11-11 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415755, 1169588, 181383, '<td valign="top">I simply don''t understand this photo.</td>', 'I simply don''t understand this photo.', '2015-11-11 15:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415756, 1169423, 181383, '<td valign="top">This photo is depressing.  Maybe that was the goal.  I upgraded my vote a bit based on that assumption.</td>', 'This photo is depressing.  Maybe that was the goal.  I upgraded my vote a bit based on that assumption.', '2015-11-11 15:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415757, 1169593, 181383, '<td valign="top">Too much out of focus for my taste.</td>', 'Too much out of focus for my taste.', '2015-11-11 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415758, 1169595, 181383, '<td valign="top">I might have rated higher, had there been more motion blur.  My eyes went to the fence rather than the car shadow.  It just didn''t work for me.</td>', 'I might have rated higher, had there been more motion blur.  My eyes went to the fence rather than the car shadow.  It just didn''t work for me.', '2015-11-11 15:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415759, 1169538, 181383, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with a little lighter hand on the vignetting slider.</td>', 'I would have liked this better with a little lighter hand on the vignetting slider.', '2015-11-11 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415832, 1169566, 93565, '<td valign="top">There are lots of other things that are drawing far more attention than the black car in this scene.</td>', 'There are lots of other things that are drawing far more attention than the black car in this scene.', '2015-11-12 02:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415833, 1169463, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice pan, quality focus and the rain is a nice touch. Not big on the center composition, as it feels very static.</td>', 'Nice pan, quality focus and the rain is a nice touch. Not big on the center composition, as it feels very static.', '2015-11-12 02:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415834, 1169496, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice job of integrating the prompt with an additional source of interest.</td>', 'Nice job of integrating the prompt with an additional source of interest.', '2015-11-12 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415835, 1169586, 93565, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly grainy for a daytime shot. Could use additional contrast in the entire photo. It''s also muddled to be portraying a Corvette as your subject... but having a giant Maserati ad in the back...</td>', 'Surprisingly grainy for a daytime shot. Could use additional contrast in the entire photo. It''s also muddled to be portraying a Corvette as your subject... but having a giant Maserati ad in the back...', '2015-11-12 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415836, 1169564, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not what I was expecting, but awesome colors and textures, interesting subject.</td>', 'Not what I was expecting, but awesome colors and textures, interesting subject.', '2015-11-12 02:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415837, 1169385, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the editing, composition/perspective don''t favor the nuances of the car, instead compressing and minimizing them.</td>', 'Not a fan of the editing, composition/perspective don''t favor the nuances of the car, instead compressing and minimizing them.', '2015-11-12 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415838, 1169538, 93565, '<td valign="top">Editing is extremely heavy handed. Needs work on masking, vignette is overdone. Due to editing, I''m visually VERY drawn to the random SUV/minivan in the back left, which is very sharp and very bright. Your edges on the vignette are far too extreme and the image as a whole has been pushed too hard.</td>', 'Editing is extremely heavy handed. Needs work on masking, vignette is overdone. Due to editing, I''m visually VERY drawn to the random SUV/minivan in the back left, which is very sharp and very bright. Your edges on the vignette are far too extreme and the image as a whole has been pushed too hard.', '2015-11-12 02:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415839, 1169383, 93565, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out if that is the worlds dirtiest windshield or an interesting reflection. Interesting effect.</td>', 'I can''t figure out if that is the worlds dirtiest windshield or an interesting reflection. Interesting effect.', '2015-11-12 02:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415840, 1169542, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice car, pleasing portrayal, well done.</td>', 'Nice car, pleasing portrayal, well done.', '2015-11-12 02:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415841, 1169581, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see more of the vehicle itself, but this is an interesting perspective.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see more of the vehicle itself, but this is an interesting perspective.', '2015-11-12 02:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415842, 1169541, 93565, '<td valign="top">The post top left is super distracting, largely due to it being a similar color to the car, and it''s positioned like a giant horrible antenna that shouldn''t be there. Easy clone job. The ground seems to be weird too.. I''m assuming some editing was done there but the end result is overly smooth and strange. I assume there was something you tried to cover up, but the end result doesn''t seem to mesh up well with the tires. Cool car, could be a great capture but minor issues hold it back.</td>', 'The post top left is super distracting, largely due to it being a similar color to the car, and it''s positioned like a giant horrible antenna that shouldn''t be there. Easy clone job. The ground seems to be weird too.. I''m assuming some editing was done there but the end result is overly smooth and strange. I assume there was something you tried to cover up, but the end result doesn''t seem to mesh up well with the tires. Cool car, could be a great capture but minor issues hold it back.', '2015-11-12 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415843, 1169562, 93565, '<td valign="top">Masking needs some work, as the blur is pretty obvious and some portions (the red car further into the frame, seen through the windshield, is perfectly sharp, as well as the roadway, your PS blurred areas aren''t consistent with how a lens would blur the scene) that are in focus should not be. Angle of the shot includes too many vehicles not intended to be in the shot. Get lower to gain interest instead of shooting at eye level.</td>', 'Masking needs some work, as the blur is pretty obvious and some portions (the red car further into the frame, seen through the windshield, is perfectly sharp, as well as the roadway, your PS blurred areas aren''t consistent with how a lens would blur the scene) that are in focus should not be. Angle of the shot includes too many vehicles not intended to be in the shot. Get lower to gain interest instead of shooting at eye level.', '2015-11-12 03:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415844, 1169546, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d like higher sharpness, but I also really like the low-key nature of this shot. The way the highlights are contouring the car is very nice. I''d probably change the composition so the car was at the rear of the frame, so it has room to travel, but that''s a personal choice. Nice shot.</td>', 'I''d like higher sharpness, but I also really like the low-key nature of this shot. The way the highlights are contouring the car is very nice. I''d probably change the composition so the car was at the rear of the frame, so it has room to travel, but that''s a personal choice. Nice shot.', '2015-11-12 03:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415845, 1169423, 93565, '<td valign="top">The lout color of the car is very strongly muted. The trees also appear to be in color. Perhaps the car was intended to be muted in its presence in the scene, but it feels almost incidental in a "Car/Automobile" challenge.</td>', 'The lout color of the car is very strongly muted. The trees also appear to be in color. Perhaps the car was intended to be muted in its presence in the scene, but it feels almost incidental in a "Car/Automobile" challenge.', '2015-11-12 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415847, 1169514, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great color palate, great job having the car be in the frame but complimented by everything else around it. Well done. ETA: My pic for the best image, bumped to a 9 to reflect such</td>', 'Great color palate, great job having the car be in the frame but complimented by everything else around it. Well done. ETA: My pic for the best image, bumped to a 9 to reflect such', '2015-11-12 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7416060, 1169546, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the slight light trailed following the car.  My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the slight light trailed following the car.  My favorite of the challenge.', '2015-11-13 12:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
