(7416702, 1169541, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert:</b></div><hr/><i> This was a 5 hours shooting session. People don''t realize how difficult it is to get such a low angle from a car that is so low to the ground. My camera on the ground was not even low enough. my lens was touching the ground. My friend who is owner of this supercars rental company was very helpful to move the cars where I wanted to position them. I used natural light and as the sunlight was moving during the hours, we had to move the cars each time. I took about 1000 pictures of his cars. It will be published in the 2016 calendar of his company. It was extremely difficult to choose my favorite picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> Well George that is dedication to the art.</td>', 'Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert: This was a 5 hours shooting session. People don''t realize how difficult it is to get such a low angle from a car that is so low to the ground. My camera on the ground was not even low enough. my lens was touching the ground. My friend who is owner of this supercars rental company was very helpful to move the cars where I wanted to position them. I used natural light and as the sunlight was moving during the hours, we had to move the cars each time. I took about 1000 pictures of his cars. It will be published in the 2016 calendar of his company. It was extremely difficult to choose my favorite picture.    Well George that is dedication to the art.', '2015-11-16 21:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
