(7418300, 1169463, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>I''m sure this WAS fun to shoot!  And... you''ve captured at least this one well.   Lovely job at panning to keep the subject in focus and get that fabulously blurred background to show us the speed of the vehicle.<br/> <br/>I really like how the rain added that gorgeous blue stripe on the pavement.<br/> <br/>I do wish you''d taken advantage of the entire 1200 pixels and 700MB so we could see the image larger.  I''m sure this affected your score negatively.  Perhaps some sharpening would be in order to really make this pop!<br/> <br/>I''d also suggest a crop off of some of the left of the image, to allow the car to have room to "move within the frame".  As it is, it crowds the car... since the viewer gets the idea that it''s running out of room.   If there''s more room forward than to the rear, the viewer can relax while viewing.  <br/> <br/>Overall, this scored about where I would have expected it to... without the benefit of the voters being able to see it clearly (with the reduced size).<br/> <br/>I''m glad you''re back at DPC.   Keep entering, please.  It''s fun to see how far you''ve come since your first race car entry years ago.  Well done!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! I''m sure this WAS fun to shoot!  And... you''ve captured at least this one well.   Lovely job at panning to keep the subject in focus and get that fabulously blurred background to show us the speed of the vehicle. I really like how the rain added that gorgeous blue stripe on the pavement. I do wish you''d taken advantage of the entire 1200 pixels and 700MB so we could see the image larger.  I''m sure this affected your score negatively.  Perhaps some sharpening would be in order to really make this pop! I''d also suggest a crop off of some of the left of the image, to allow the car to have room to "move within the frame".  As it is, it crowds the car... since the viewer gets the idea that it''s running out of room.   If there''s more room forward than to the rear, the viewer can relax while viewing.   Overall, this scored about where I would have expected it to... without the benefit of the voters being able to see it clearly (with the reduced size). I''m glad you''re back at DPC.   Keep entering, please.  It''s fun to see how far you''ve come since your first race car entry years ago.  Well done! ', '2015-11-24 12:24:17.000000', NULL, 0);
